  "body_html": "<h1>Support Of A Mixed Strategy</h1>\n<p>The support of a mixed strategy $x \\in \\Delta(I)$ is the set\n$$\n  \\operatorname{supp}(x)=\\{i \\in I : x_i&gt;0\\}.\n$$</p>",
